  Restarting each case from the SAME converged Re=300 field and running 400 steps,
  so any difference is the tolerance and not the initial transient.
  Discretisation error here is O(h^2) ~ 1e-3, so a linear residual far below that
  should be invisible in the answer -- the question is where 'far below' starts.

